{"key":"StoryData/P10710.json|/dataList/9/content","kr_sha":"f656b30dd110e0e170893072377a1538804a246c325997f7915cf09c912b7b87","zh":"哈。真是笑不出來。索性沒有這種東西更好。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
